    "type": "leader",
    "difficulty": 13,
    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Leader</h3>\n<p><em>A seasoned bandit in quality leathers with a strong voice.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Bully, command, profit, reinforce</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 13 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 7/14 | <strong>HP:</strong> 6 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +2 | Weapon: Melee | 1d8+3 phy</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Local Knowledge +2</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Tactician - Action</strong>: When you spotlight the Lieutenant, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to also spotlight two allies within Close range.</p>\n<p><strong>More Where That Came From - Action</strong>: Summon three Bandit Lackeys at Far range.</p>\n<p><strong>Coup de Grace - Action</strong>: Spend 1 Fear to attack a Vulnerable target within Close. On a success, deal 2d6+12 physical damage and the target marks a Stress.</p>\n<p><strong>Momentum - Reaction</strong>: When the Lieutenant hits a PC with an attack, you gain 1 Fear.</p>\n",
